{
  "id": "NEH.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "NEH",
  "reference": "Nehemiah 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NEH 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now it came to pass, when Sanballat, and Tobiah, and Geshem the Arabian, and the rest of our enemies, heard that I had builded the wall, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "there was no breach left therein; (though at that time I had not set up the doors upon the gates;)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That Sanballat and Geshem sent unto me, saying, Come, let us meet together in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "some one of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the villages in the plain of Ono. But they thought to do me mischief.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I sent messengers unto them, saying, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "doing a great work, so that I cannot come down: why should the work cease, whilst I leave it, and come down to you?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet they sent unto me four times after this sort; and I answered them after the same manner.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then sent Sanballat his servant unto me in like manner the fifth time with an open letter in his hand;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherein",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "written, It is reported among the heathen, and Gashmu saith",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it, that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou and the Jews think to rebel: for which cause thou buildest the wall, that thou mayest be their king, according to these words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou hast also appointed prophets to preach of thee at Jerusalem, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a king in Judah: and now shall it be reported to the king according to these words. Come now therefore, and let us take counsel together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I sent unto him, saying, There are no such things done as thou sayest, but thou feignest them out of thine own heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they all made us afraid, saying, Their hands shall be weakened from the work, that it be not done. Now therefore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "O God",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", strengthen my hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterward I came unto the house of Shemaiah the son of Delaiah the son of Mehetabeel, who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shut up; and he said, Let us meet together in the house of God, within the temple, and let us shut the doors of the temple: for they will come to slay thee; yea, in the night will they come to slay thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I said, Should such a man as I flee? and who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", would go into the temple to save his life? I will not go in.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And, lo, I perceived that God had not sent him; but that he pronounced this prophecy against me: for Tobiah and Sanballat had hired him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he hired, that I should be afraid, and do so, and sin, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they might have",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "matter",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for an evil report, that they might reproach me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My God, think thou upon Tobiah and Sanballat according to these their works, and on the prophetess Noadiah, and the rest of the prophets, that would have put me in fear.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ So the wall was finished in the twenty and fifth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "day",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the month",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elul, in fifty and two days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, that when all our enemies heard",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thereof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and all the heathen that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "about us saw",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "these things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", they were much cast down in their own eyes: for they perceived that this work was wrought of our God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Moreover in those days the nobles of Judah sent many letters unto Tobiah, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
